+# WO-001BI-R116: 修 装包器 错误提示 中文 (Rust 端硬编码英文)
+
+[装机 user 8/31 拍]
+- 装包器更新失败 UI 截图证明: 副文案 "wenshu update failed (exit Some(1))..." 英文
+
+[真值]
+- 装包器错误信息硬编码在 apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/src/update.rs:316
+- "wenshu update failed (exit {:?}). See {} for details." - 英文
+- 装 user 截图大标题 + 按钮已中文化 (R112 修), 副文案漏
+
+[修法 (R116 PM-direct 自家改)]
+- 改 apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/src/update.rs:316
+- "wenshu update failed (exit {:?}). See {} for details."
+  → "文枢 更新失败 (退出码 {:?})。详情请查看 {}。"
+
+[装机 user 必走 4 步]
+1. brew install pnpm (装 pnpm)
+2. which pnpm 验证 (PATH 应有 pnpm)
+3. 跑 wenshu setup --update --yes 重试
+4. 验 4 件 + 反馈
+- 错误提示会显 "文枢 更新失败 (退出码 1)。详情请查看 ..." 中文
+
+[架构真根因 - 装 user 8/31 反复反馈]
+- bootstrap-installer.log 末 5 行:
+  - ✗ macOS release rebuild failed: pnpm was not found on PATH
+  - npm error No workspaces found: --workspace=legacy-terminal-ui --workspace=web
+  - ⚠ Node.js dependency refresh did not complete cleanly; the installation may be in a mixed state
+- 装 user 装 venv 仓 (R53 install.sh 用的 uv) - 没 pnpm
+- wenshu setup --update 跑 cargo tauri build / pnpm dist:mac 失败 (pnpm 找不到)
+- 装 user 跑 update 流程 (不需 pnpm) - 跑不动 pnpm dist:mac 这一步
+- R113 commit 9c4445984 加 pnpm dist:mac + cargo tauri build 步骤 - 但装 user 没 pnpm
+
+[版本号]
